<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bilsborough et al. (2011), Barkoulas et al. (2008), Vlad et al. (2014) & Kierzkowski et al. (2019) growing leaf margin PIN1-Auxin-CUC2-RCO feedback loop and serration vs compound leaflet dissection — Model fidelity to source: 55/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Integrates a static 1D ring of 48 epidermal cells with up-the-gradient PIN1 polarization and Auxin-CUC2 mutual antagonism (L22-55), but omits the growing 2D leaf margin contour PDE v_n(s) = v_0 [A(s)^m/(K_g^m+A(s)^m)] (1 - eta C(s)), intercalary tooth/leaflet insertion at critical wavelength lambda_c, unrepressed ectopic `cuc2-1D` control, and *Cardamine hirsuta* RCO sinus growth repression." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

