<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bilsborough et al. (2011), Barkoulas et al. (2008), Vlad et al. (2014) & Kierzkowski et al. (2019) growing leaf margin PIN1-Auxin-CUC2-RCO feedback loop and serration vs compound leaflet dissection — MorphoEval overall 53.5/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py` (weighted score: 54.4/100). The Pass 1 script integrates only a static 1D periodic ring of 48 margin cells for wild-type and `cuc2` loss-of-function without a growing 1D/2D leaf blade contour PDE, without intercalary tooth/leaflet insertion when inter-peak arc-length exceeds critical wavelength lambda_c, without the full 6-genotype morphospace comparison (`cuc2-1`, `cuc2-1D` unrepressed uniform CUC2, *Arabidopsis* WT Col-0, `mir164a-4`, *Cardamine* `rco` mutant, and *Cardamine hirsuta* WT compound leaflets with RCO sinus growth repression), and without empirical CV segmentation of the vendored *Cardamine hirsuta* specimen photograph. Overall 53.5/100 (faithfulness 50.8, reproducibility 59.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 55, Morphological realism / specimen match 45, Parameter expressivity 52, Morphometric validation 54, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 58, Reproducibility package 54. Output judged: docs/media/allometric_compound_leaf_comparison.png: rendered output of 2011-przemyslaw-allometric-compound-leaf.py at 8871db0, image/png, 86936 B, 1540×630 px, artifact_sha256 f3c1906ac6a9bf0f0755eddb5552d6071b0ea8512e341e3ae157f6dd216c7317 (sha256 f3c1906ac6a9bf0f0755eddb5552d6071b0ea8512e341e3ae157f6dd216c7317), spec_fingerprint f7e327f643238b6973cf1043ff1d25ce8c9a027859b313633da11bdc256da7cd. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: f7e327f643238b6973cf1043ff1d25ce8c9a027859b313633da11bdc256da7cd; artifact_sha256: f3c1906ac6a9bf0f0755eddb5552d6071b0ea8512e341e3ae157f6dd216c7317; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/allometric_compound_leaf/allometric_compound_leaf_reference.json=fa4f9b265dd83379..., datasets/allometric_compound_leaf/cardamine_hirsuta_compound_leaf_specimen.jpg=1c268fecb3660b31..., datasets/allometric_compound_leaf/paper_citations.bib=8245ac5ad5a33db0..., datasets/allometric_compound_leaf/scout_manifest.json=46ea1539febdb312...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement a growing 1D/2D leaf margin contour PDE solver coupling Loop 1 (CUC2-promoted PIN1 up-the-gradient polarization rho_{ij} propto (1 + gamma_CUC2 C_i) exp(beta A_j)), Loop 2 (Auxin transcriptional repression of CUC2, C_i = C_max / (1 + (A_i/K_A)^n)), and Loop 3 (differential normal margin outgrowth v_n(s) = v_0 [A(s)^m/(K_g^m + A(s)^m)] (1 - eta_sinus C(s))) with intercalary cell division and new auxin peak insertion whenever inter-peak arc-length exceeds critical wavelength lambda_c across developmental stages P3-P6.",
        "remediation needed: Segment the SHA-256-verified *Cardamine hirsuta* compound leaf specimen (`cardamine_hirsuta_compound_leaf_specimen.jpg`) to extract foliage area fraction, 32 compound leaflet lobes, perimeter dissection ratio P/(2*sqrt(pi*A)) = 4.0939, and radial tip-to-sinus dissection depth index I_D = 0.5202, and expose an 8-check deterministic `--self-test` suite.",
        "remediation needed: Simulate the full 6-genotype morphospace panel: `cuc2-1` loss-of-function smooth margin (C = 0), `cuc2-1D` unrepressed uniform CUC2 negative control (C = C_0), *Arabidopsis thaliana* Col-0 wild-type shallow serration (eta = 0.42), `mir164a-4` deep serration (eta = 0.65), *Cardamine hirsuta* `rco` mutant simplified lobes (eta = 0.48), and *Cardamine hirsuta* wild-type pinnate compound leaflets with RCO sinus growth repression (eta = 0.88)." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.35e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

